      "outcomes": "Hit, miss, critical, opportunity and native Multiattack children select the same explicit anatomical row. One emitted attack fact owns one contact; art turns and repeated swipes create no extra native hits. Separate AttackVfx tracks are explicitly empty.",
      "movement": "Run owns the gait only. Native recorded path/height owns displacement. Jump uses Rolling as an explicitly normalized pack jump/roll adaptation. Window uses CrouchWalk with its own frame keys and existing connector passage scale.",
      "flight": "Open-wing Idle is a deliberate glide pose for recorded flying path; no Fly strip or invented wing-flap animation is claimed. Arc and window have exact separate bindings.",
      "prone": "Intact non-exploding fall, explicit frame-14 living rest pose, reverse stand-up. Death continues to use the compatible shared death owner; summoned departure is separate.",
      "ordinary_actions": "Body action, recovery, equipment, healing and optional save-avoidance gestures explicitly disabled with neutral Idle. Existing native effects, feedback and child joins remain authoritative. Shove uses the primary physical strike; forced movement uses TakeDamage brace 5.",
      "unarmed": "Rig-scoped unarmed physical-strike adaptation uses the inspected primary motion; this grants no native action.",
      "validation_scope": "Original strip/direction/support inspection and typed binding checks; full live native fight, historical replay, height/occlusion and Fey material acceptance are separate packet-5 integration checks."
